      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דָּבֵק</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo. aderente, apegado</strong> (a), <span dir=\"rtl\">דּ׳</span> absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיֵשׁ אֹהֵב דָּבֵק מֵאָח</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.24\">Pv 18.24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבֵקָה לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.12\">2Cr 3.12</a> (da asa do querubim); de apegar-se a <span dir=\"rtl\">הַדְּבֵקִים בְּ י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.4\">Dt 4.4</a>.",
